<h2>Which one do you need?</h2>
<p>MCP is the connection. After you add it, the agent can actually run ContHunt on your account.</p>
<p>The skill is optional. It does not connect anything by itself. It tells the agent what ContHunt is and how to use it, so you do not have to explain the product every time.</p>
<p>Most people add MCP first, then the skill.</p>
